f pilots from the United Colony. Captain Minase of the Hagwane must decide to fight the Granzon or retreat."},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4761","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77745","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81111","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"98378","synopsis":"Can both sides join forces to force the common enemy to retreat?"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4761","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77745","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81111","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"98380","synopsis":"Plissken is putting together a team as the strengths and weakness of Ryuusei, Aya and Kusuha come into play and their simulators run them through their paces."},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4761","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77745","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81111","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"98379","synopsis":"A transport vessel headed toward the Hagwane comes under fire by Armored Modules piloted by Divine Crusaders pilots Tomas and Tenzan, ultimately leading to a confrontation between Ryuusei and his \"Burning PT\" rival Tenzan."},{"title":"Episodio 14","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4761","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77745","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81111","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"98382","synopsis":"Success in taking over satellite communications from Earth’s forces has given the United Colony Corps control of space. The Federation must send both assault carriers, and the Personal Troopers into an all-out battle against the United Colony Corps."},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4761","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77745","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81111","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"98381","synopsis":"The various Federation teams need to buy some time, even as a new battle arrives on the horizon. We learn the backstory of a United Colony Corps pilot who is part of the Elite Aggressors group who has a grudge against the Earth Federation Army."},{"title":"Episodio 16","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4761","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1603","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"77745","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81111","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"98384","synopsis":"Th